OL,3,GNEWSAHow I crunched the odds for horse 
OL,4,Aracing's 'bible'                       
OL,6,FPeter Jones was once responsible for   
OL,7,Fhalf of the publication known as horse 
OL,8,Fracing's "bible" from his home in rural
OL,9,FDorset.                                
OL,11,FHe has lived in Melplash, for almost 50
OL,12,Fyears and nowadays he is treasurer of  
OL,13,Fthe village church - but in the 1970s  
OL,14,Fhe was all about data.                 
OL,16,F"I published books on racing under the 
OL,17,Fname of Trainers Record," he said on   
OL,18,FBBC Radio Solent.                      
