OL,3,GNEWSAHow I crunched the odds for horse 
OL,4,Aracing's 'bible'                       
OL,6,F"In order to compile that, I had to    
OL,7,Fhave a racing database in the days     
OL,8,Fbefore computers were generally        
OL,9,Favailable to the public."              
